# What he just said, on Now: a question answered from its page folds on Now to "answer → topic"
# with Undo while hex has it; Undo puts it back. The stand-in keeps every write from reaching hex.
launch /
tap home-row-*
tap ask-option-*
open /
shoot now-said
tap undo-*
shoot now-undone
launch /?update=demo
shoot toast
tap update-install
shoot toast-installing
